# Hand-derived expected index frame F-M1 (plan 08-03, D-02, D-03, D-05): ivs-diag-stic-2, scene M1 of the selector 7E.
# Derivation: docs/video/diag-stic-2-derivation.md section (e), written before the program, the renderer or any run; never produced by a run: one MOB, X size and Y size 2x, placed at the right and bottom edges so that it is clipped.
# Plane grammar: 96 rows after the line plane, each 20 groups of 8 symbols (0-9A-F, and - inside a declared unknown rectangle) separated by one space; the 8th symbol of group 20
# is the cut-off pixel of the 7-pixel last column (clip side right) and is written -. The published plane is the 159 columns left of it.
# Cards: the stack 1 2 3 4 and the border 8 are the register values of the program; the only listed card cell is (6,10), the card of GRAM 2 with foreground 2; every other cell is the fill word 0000.
